# Kept on purpose (do not ignore):
#   weights/microgpt.bin   - lets a reviewer verify the golden values without training
#   data/*.txt             - the exact evaluation splits the numbers come from
#   input.txt              - the source corpus, so the repo reproduces offline
#   bench/results/*.json   - the evidence behind the reported numbers
